<title>INDIA: Indian gold steady, silver falls.</title>
<headline>Indian gold steady, silver falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>** Gold 24 carat closed lower at 4,820 rupees per 10 gramme off morning highs on fresh slide in world prices</p>
<p>** Prices of gold biscuit (116.50 gramme) fell 100 rupees to 56,300 after starting at 56,500 rupees.</p>
<p>** Silver (.999) eased on fresh arrivals of imported silver and sluggish industrial demand.</p>
<p>--</p>
